        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Onancock%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ker Place is a Federal‑era house museum that houses the Eastern Shore of Virginia Historical Society.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://onancock.com/visitor/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Historic Onancock School sits on a 13‑acre campus with a nature trail along Onancock Creek, offering recreation and walking.",
